@model HomePageModel
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Find your study abroad mentor"; }
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> REAL STUDENTS. REAL ANSWERS.</div><h1>Ask about<br/><span class="serif">where to study</span><br/>to a current student.</h1><p class="hero-text">A little guidance can change everything. Talk to someone who’s already been there.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-dark" href="/find-mentor">Talk to your AbroadMate <span>↗</span></a><a class="button button-light" href="/group-sessions">Explore group sessions</a></div><p class="hero-note">For undergrad, master’s, MBA, PhD, ECA, work abroad &amp; test prep</p></div><div class="hero-art"><div class="art-shape"></div><div class="sun"></div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1523240795612-9a054b0db644?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1000&amp;q=85" alt="University students talking"/></div><div class="floating-card"><div class="mini-check">✓</div><div><strong>Real advice,<br/>from real students</strong><small>Every step of the way</small></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section intro"><div class="section-kicker">A BETTER WAY TO FIGURE IT OUT</div><h2>Study abroad is a big move.<br/><span class="serif">You don't have to make it alone.</span></h2><p>Skip the guesswork and get the honest version from someone who has lived the experience you’re planning for.</p><div class="stats"><div><strong>4.8<span>★</span></strong><small>Average session rating</small></div><div><strong>93<span>%</span></strong><small>Come back for round two</small></div><div><strong>100<span>+</span></strong><small>Schools represented</small></div></div></section>
<section class="section discovery" id="countries"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">YOUR DESTINATION, YOUR PEOPLE</div><h2>Find your place<br/><span class="serif">in the world.</span></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/find-mentor">Explore all mentors ↗</a></div><div class="country-grid">@foreach (var country in Model.Countries) { <a class="country-card" href="/countries/@Uri.EscapeDataString(country.Name)"><span>@country.Name<small>@country.MentorCount mentors · Meet your people ↗</small></span></a> }</div></section>
<section class="section featured-mentors"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">MEET YOUR ABROADMATES</div><h2>Been there.<br/><span class="serif">Happy to help.</span></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/find-mentor">Meet all mentors ↗</a></div><div class="mentor-grid">@foreach (var mentor in Model.Mentors) { <partial name="_MentorCard" model="mentor"/> }</div></section>
<section class="section scholarship-section"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="section-kicker">MAKE YOUR DREAM MORE POSSIBLE</div><h2>Scholarships, with<br/><span class="serif">someone in your corner.</span></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/scholarships">Explore scholarships ↗</a></div><div class="scholar-grid"><a class="scholar-card" href="/scholarships"><span class="scholar-mark">EU</span><div><b>Erasmus Mundus</b><small>Study across Europe</small></div><span>↗</span></a><a class="scholar-card" href="/scholarships"><span class="scholar-mark rose">CH</span><div><b>Chevening</b><small>Study in the United Kingdom</small></div><span>↗</span></a><a class="scholar-card" href="/scholarships"><span class="scholar-mark gold">FL</span><div><b>Fulbright</b><small>Study in the United States</small></div><span>↗</span></a></div></section>
<section class="session-promo"><div class="session-promo-copy"><div class="section-kicker">BETTER TOGETHER</div><h2>Big questions.<br/><span class="serif">Good company.</span></h2><p>Join a friendly live session with mentors and other students on the same journey.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="/group-sessions">Explore group sessions <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="session-art"><div class="session-img img-one"></div><div class="session-img img-two"></div><div class="session-img img-three"></div></div></section>
<section class="section faq-section" id="faq"><div><div class="section-kicker">GOOD THINGS TO KNOW</div><h2>Questions?<br/><span class="serif">We’ve got you.</span></h2><p><a href="/faq">Visit all FAQs ↗</a></p></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>What is AbroadMates?<span>+</span></summary><p>We connect study abroad applicants with current students who offer first-hand guidance.</p></details><details><summary>How does a mentorship call work?<span>+</span></summary><p>Choose a mentor and a 20 or 40 minute plan, pick a time, and bring your questions.</p></details></div></section>
